window.products.push({"id":771040,"name":"Sensitic Boba Cup Set - 2 Reusable Bubble Boba Cups With Lids, 1 White Cup Sleeve, 2 Stainless Steel Straws, Brush - Double Wall Glass Tumblers for Bu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kXIYjLudL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s a reason why people go crazy over bubble tea. And that’s because it’s addicting and delicious. There are many recipes ranging from coffee milk tea to fresh, sweet, and fruity flavors. Still, while you have a long list of delectable potential toppings, the distinct texture of the chewy tapioca pearls always steals the show. These days, bubble tea is everywhere. You can even enjoy it at home because it’s so easy to make! So, if you’re ready to proclaim yourself a true bubble tea connoisseur, there’s no better way to say it out loud than with a special bubble tea cup. Indulge in your love for boba anytime and anywhere with this fantastic Boba Cup Set by Sensitic! This drink set includes two 24oz tumblers, two stainless-steel straws, and a brush to help you keep everything ready to use and squeaky clean. Its wide mouth and mason jar shape fits a spoon and makes for easy pouring, so it’s the perfect vehicle for trying out your homemade recipes! Double walls help keep cold drinks cool and hot drinks warm so that you can use it for any beverage. Besides bubble tea, it’s perfect for blended smoothies, hot or iced coffee, milkshakes, cocoa, and juice. The fashionable white cup sleeve can help protect your fingers from slippery condensation or a scalding surface. Of the two lids, one is a white plastic lid that completely seals the cup, while the other is a bamboo lid with a hole for a straw. By using reusable utensils, you’re helping the world cut down on its consumption of wasteful single-use materials. So, let your love for boba help you love the earth! Here’s more to know and love about with our adorable boba cup bundle: - Durable travel cups - Food-grade materials - 24oz–standard cup size - Easy to clean If you love your drinks, take them with you! Add the Sensitic Boba Cup Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kXIYjLudL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sensitic","source_asin":"B09X2S8VRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X2S8VRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X2S8VRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
