window.products.push({"id":771081,"name":"Can Crusher with Built in Bottle Opener – Wall Mounted – Hand Operated – Manual – Crushes Aluminum Cans and Plastic Bottles up to 16 oz by Mazeluxe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E7GWiDx0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAN CRUSHER – do your bit for the planet and compact your cans and plastic bottles before placing them in recycling. By squashing them down you are saving space, reducing waste and making it easier for recycling plants to handle plastic and aluminum waste SIZE INFORMATION – designed for domestic use you can easily introduce our can crusher into your home without it taking up too much space. Measuring 13 inches x 4.5 inches it can be used in the kitchen, home bar area, garage or outdoors if protected from the weather EASY TO INSTALL – for your safety and optimum performance the plastic bottle and aluminum can crusher should be securely installed on to a solid timber table, bench or wall which is easily done with the screws and wall plugs included with your purchase WHAT CAN BE CRUSHED – use our soda can crusher for small 12 oz cans, large 16 oz cans and plastic bottles up to 500ml. This includes water bottles, soda bottles, juice bottles, beer cans, soda cans and any other aluminum can or plastic bottle that fits within the size range. Please remove all lids from plastic bottles before placing in the crusher RANGE OF COLOR OPTIONS – our plastic bottle and beer can crusher is available in 4 colors. Choose between black, blue, grey and red to match your existing décor or for it to discreetly blend in with your existing home layout. The handle of all 4 color choices is black. All color options have an integrated bottle opener on the base","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E7GWiDx0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mazeluxe","source_asin":"B0BT52GHRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT52GHRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT52GHRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":771082,"name":"Non-Slip Velvet Clothes Hangers Premium Heavy Duty Space Saving with 360 Swivel &Rose Gold Hanger Hook for for Dress, Coats, Jackets, Pants, Shirts, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j-k954QZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you hate organizing your closet? Tired of your clothes slipping off the hangers? Do you hate wooden hangers taking up too much space? Do you want a tidy, organized and elegant closet? Comfy mee 50-pack grey plastic hanger is the best choice for your closet, especially for your dorm room, condo, or apartment. With these premium velvet hangers for clothes, you can use less time to organize your closet in good order. These velvet clothes hangers are perfect for indoor wardrobe organization. Product Features: ✔Sturdy ABS rubber coating plastic clothes hangers with velvet surface prevent your clothes from slipping off or creasing. ✔Non slip stripes hangers bars for hanging pants. ✔The plastics hangers measure 16.5 inches, perfect size hangers for men and women's clothes. ✔The 360° swivel hooks can hang your garments or take them easily. ✔The clothes hanger has two non-slip notches to prevent your strapped garments or other accessories from falling off the floor. ✔The slim and sleek design maximizes your closet space and match your wardrobe. ✔The plastic clothes hangers can hold up heavy garments in 11 lbs. Specifications: Material: ABS Plastic+velvet Size of Each Hanger: 16.5”L x 0.2”W x 8.5”H (42 x 0.6 x 21.5 cm) Weight of Each Hanger: 2.9 oz (83 g) Load Capacity of Each Hanger: 11 lb (5 kg) Package Contents: 50 x Clothes Hanger NOTE: If you use a velvet hanger to hang wet clothes, it will cause the velvet coating to depreciate and even dye your clothes, so try not to hang wet clothes with velvet hangers. If you have any issue with our products, please don't hesitate to contact us, we will try our best to find a satisfactory solution for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j-k954QZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAGAU","source_asin":"B07X8G4JCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X8G4JCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X8G4JCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":771083,"name":"SUYAOVO Large Beige Bathroom Rugs, 24x36 inches Microfiber Bath Rugs, Non-Slip Bath Rugs for Bathroom, Ultra Soft and Absorbent Shaggy Bath Mats, Mach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SiOCfpwtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH DENSITY MICROFIBER RUG: Our bathmat is made with high-density microfiber, which provides excellent absorbency without leaving your feet feeling wet. This bath rug is perfect for adding a soft and comfortable touch to your bathroom decor. SUPER COMFORTABLE MAT: SUYAOVO rug is designed to be super comfortable, providing a plush and cozy feel for your bare feet. The thick microfiber fabric helps to prevent water drips and absorbs water from your feet quickly, making it ideal for use in your bathroom. With its soft and comfortable texture, you'll feel like you're getting a mini-massage every time you step on it. ANTI-SLIP RUG FOR BATHROOM FLOOR: SUYAOVO bathroom carpet features an anti-slip design that provides excellent grip and durability. Unlike other brands that use rubber backing, our bathmat features TP rubber backing, which is stronger and more durable. This ensures that our rug for floor stays in place and does not slip or slide around, making it safer to use in wet areas like your bathroom floor. MACHINE WASHABLE BATHROOM RUG: Our bath carpet is machine washable, making it easy to clean and maintain. Simply wash it separately with cold water and mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach), and then tumble dry on low or hang to dry. It is non-shedding, and its unique fiber locking technology ensures that it looks brand new even after multiple washes. MULTIPLE USAGE BATH CARPET: SUYAOVO rug is not just for your bathroom floor. It can also be used in other areas of your home, such as your bedroom, living room, kitchen, entryway, mudroom, and hallway. Our mat comes in multiple sizes, making it easy to find the perfect fit for your room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SiOCfpwtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUYAOVO","source_asin":"B0BPRVQ2Z1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPRVQ2Z1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPRVQ2Z1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
