window.products.push({"id":771228,"name":"Old Modern Handicrafts 1901 Edison Standard Model A Phonograph, One Size, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MwxiemwYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The phonograph was invented in 1877 by Thomas Edison (1847-1931) and was the first machine to be able to reproduce the recorded sound. Edison has been described as America's greatest inventor. This is a non-functional replica phonograph of the 1901 Edison Standard Model A machinery. This \"New Style\" case was introduced around 1901 and looks very different from the square suitcase Standard that was its predecessor. Our phonograph display model is realistically handmade out of tin. It features many intricate details such as case, removable horn, cylinder, sound box, belt, windup key, stop lever, and much more. Proudly display this model anywhere you like and it will surely make a conversational piece. A must-have for the collector and enthusiast!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MwxiemwYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Modern Handicrafts","source_asin":"B07ZJ6RTJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZJ6RTJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZJ6RTJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":771229,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 1 lb Tumbled Crystal Quartz A Grade Stones from Brazil - Large - 1.25\" to 1.75\" avg.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617bk7QhO0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fantasia brand 'A' Grade Large Crystal Quartz is imported directly from the Brazilian mine to Fantasia Mining's USA rock yard. This material has a spectacular shine and contains extremely large size tumbled stones. In the final stage of tumbling, Fantasia uses a special high gloss polish so their crystal quartz has a superior shine and luster. Your order will contain a random scoop with a minimum of 1 pound of this exquisite 'A' Grade Crystal Quartz. This material is sold by weight and you will receive multiple pieces in your order to equal the weight purchased.Metaphysical Properties: Quartz is a power stone that channels universal energy. It enhances and strengthens the meanings of other stones, while also absorbing, storing, amplifying, focusing and transmiting energy. Quartz helps with clarity of mind, allowing one to increase focus and concentration. It clears away negative energy and is used as a protective stone. Quartz is an amazing stone for helping to balance one's environment and keep equilibrium in daily life. All of these characteristics make quartz the most versitile of all crystals. Scientific Information: Quartz is the second-most-abundant mineral in the Earth's continental crust. It is made up of a continuous framework of SiO4 silicon–oxygen tetrahedra, with each oxygen being shared between two tetrahedra, giving an overall formula SiO2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617bk7QhO0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B07XJKZ89H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XJKZ89H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XJKZ89H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
