window.products.push({"id":771858,"name":"KLEIN Single Serve Pour Over Coffee Kit – Portable Pour-Over Coffee Maker With Dripper – Perfect for Home, Office, Travel & Backpacking – Premium 50 M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rbf1I1kPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INCLUDED - Stainless steel fine-mesh filter - 200ml Double-layered glass cup with lid - Carrying case EASY TO USE Pour Over: 1. Put coffee grounds into the filter. 2. Pour hot water over grounds and allow to steep until desired richness. 3. Remove the filter and discard the grounds, enjoy! Cold Brew: 1. Pour coffee grounds and water into the filter. 2. Cover with lid and allow to steep for 12-24 hours. 3. Remove the filter and discard the grounds, enjoy! All components are dishwasher safe MAKE COFFEE ON-THE-GO This single serve coffee maker is designed to craft the perfect cup wherever life may take you. No reason you can’t have coffee how you like it while at work, traveling, or on the top of a mountain! The double layered filter is designed to maximise flavor while keeping your brew grit-free. KLEIN COFFEE KIT We work hard (and drink hundreds of cups of coffee) to design this small coffee maker. Carefully choosing the proper mesh pattern and micron size for the filter and painstakingly designing the double-layered glass cup takes time, but the results are worth it. We invite you to give our kit a try and bask in Coffee’s truest flavors. Our filter is made from a durable, food grade stainless steel wire, it has a special double-layered filter designed to invite yummy goodness from the grounds while keeping them out of our coffee. VERSATILE BREWING KIT - Pour Over Coffee - Cold Brew Coffee - Loose Leaf Tea Click Add to Cart to end your search for the perfect cup!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rbf1I1kPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Klein Industries","source_asin":"B07YHKXQBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YHKXQBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YHKXQBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
