window.products.push({"id":771973,"name":"Vacplus Moisture Absorbers, Reusable Dehumidifiers for Closet, Moisture Absorbers for Rooms with Visible Dehumidification, Humidity Absorber Boxes & O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSIfcgmJL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFICIENT ABSORPTION - The cover of Vacplus moisture absorber box with mesh design significantly enhances the ventilation through the box. Moreover, this product features spherical calcium chloride particles in the extra moisture absorber bag, which effectively enlarges its dehumidifying range and keeps the place pleasantly dry and comfortable for a longer time. VISIBLE DEHUMIDIFICATION - The lower transparent moisture box can separate the collected moisture from the spherical calcium chloride particles, efficiently improving the dehumidifying effectiveness of this product. The collected moisture can directly drop into the collecting box, in which way the dehumidifying status of the moisture removers can be clearly observed at any time. IDEAL ODOR REMOVER - With Vacplus 2-in-1 odor absorbers, there are no more worries about excess moistures and odors. Vacplus moisture absorbers can eliminate the musty smell by absorbing excess moisture while emitting a pleasant lavender smell to keep the air fresh and clean, acting like air fresheners. UNRESTRICTED PLACEMENT - Vacplus moisture absorbers are ideal dehumidifiers for home and enclosed space such as closets, bathrooms, kitchens, laundry rooms, touring cars, boats, and basements. All required is just removing the package of moisture absorber bag and placing it in the moisture absorber. Vacplus moisture absorbers always work satisfactorily wherever it is placed. MATTERS NEED ATTENTION - The cover of the dehumidifier box is removable. To prevent tipping, hold the bottom of the dehumidifier box with your hand when moving it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSIfcgmJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacplus","source_asin":"B0C65C3S1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-771973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65C3S1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65C3S1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
